2 CONT Ahmose (princess)
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Ahmose (“Child of the Moon”) was a princess of the seventeenth dynasty of Egypt. She was the only known daughter of Tao II the Brave by his sister-wife Sitdjehuti. She was the half-sister of Pharaoh Ahmose I.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was buried in the tomb QV47 in the Valley of the Queens. Her mummy is now in the Egyptian Museum in Torino.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ahmose's titles: King's Daughter; King's Sister.
2 CONT
