2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Ahmose-Meritamon
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Ahmose-Meritamon (“Child of the Moon, Beloved of Amun”) was a princess of the seventeenth dynasty of Egypt, probably a daughter of Tao II the Brave. Her titles included King's Daughter and King's Sister. She is not to be confused 
2 CONC with her niece Ahmose-Meritamon, who became the wife of Amenhotep I.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her mummy was found in the Deir el-Bahri cache and is now in the Egyptian Museum in Cairo.
