2 CONT =Osorkon II=
2 CONT '''Usermaatre Setepenamun Osorkon II''' was a pharaoh[1] of the Twenty-second Dynasty of Ancient Egypt and the son of '''Takelot I''' and '''Queen Kapes'''. He ruled Egypt around 872 BC to 837 BC from Tanis, the capital of this Dy
2 CONC nasty. 
