1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://miriamhakedosha.blogspot.com/2012/05/judith-jewish-queen-empress-of-ethiopia.html http://www.gutenberg.org/files/15784/15784-h/15784-h.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT High-Queen Asenath the Beautiful (Isnetnofret/ Istnofret/ Anath /Osnat/ Bat Sokhota) of Rhoda and Princess of Judah (b. 465) (H2 mt-dna) [Sister of Princess Tamar Tia of Tahpahnes (Tephi) (H1 mt-dna)] married Nilius (Nimlot/ Niall
2 CONC / Nel/ Nili Mu) Milesian Prince of Thebes son of Osorkon II (Osorkor/ Sokar/ Socho)
2 CONT
2 CONT The Milesians were known as the Meshwesh and the Mu (or Ma) and Velikovsky mentions them as the Temehu as distinct from the Tehenu the dark curly haired inhabitants of Libya. The name of Libyan or Libo for the Temehu(Mu/ Meshwesh/
2 CONC  Ma) is because of their blonde hair and blue eyes which was associated with the Moon. Libo and Libyan comes from the Semetic word for white Laban and moon Lebanah. Queen Hatshepsut had red blonde hair and Rameses II had red hair.
2 CONC  Other members of the Theban Dynasty had either red or blonde hair as found on an examination of their mummies. Scientific tests have also proved that Seti I the father of Rameses II also had Red hair as did Pharoah Mernptah II Si
2 CONC ptah. It would seem that King David's red hair was passed down genetically to his Egyptian descendants. Hatshepsut was the Queen of Sheba (Sheva) and the Egyptian pronunciation for Thebes is also Shiwa (Sheva or Sheba). Thebes in 
2 CONC Egypt was a settlement of the Meshwesh (Milesians/ Mu /Tehemu/ Libyans). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Recent ydna testing on the Pharoah's of the Theban (Sheba) Dynasty demonstrated that they were of R1b1a2 ydna which surprised many but confirmed for me the Davidic ancestry of the Theban Dynasty and the ideas of Velikovsky. Initia
2 CONC lly many thought this R1b was only found in Western Europe, However there has been further studies to demonstrate the Middle Eastern origin of R1b and its presence even today in many groups. Irish accounts have always claimed that
2 CONC  their ancestors came as Milesians from Egypt. The Irish monks in an attempt to outdo Manetho stretched this event back to the time of Moses. However it was in the 3rd century that the Milesians en masse of R1b-L21 ydna left Egypt
2 CONC  and North Africa for Spain and Portugal. After a short stay in Spain (Iberia/ Brigantia) they once again en masse set sail for the British Isles. One group known as the Beredi or Briganti settled in Britian to which they gave its
2 CONC  name. At the time of the Roman invasions the Brigantes were the leading tribe of Britain and the Milesians of Ireland were also known as the Heberi from which Ireland took the name of Hibernia.
2 CONT
2 CONT This reconstruction of ancient history owes much to Velikovsky however it differs from him in some major areas. Velikovsky did a great job on seeing the repetitions and mirror images in Egyptian chronology but it was Heifetz who s
2 CONC aw them in Persian history coming from a different approach to Velikovsky. Once Egyptian and Persia history are realigned then the ideas of both the Minimial and Maximist schools of Israelite historiography become redundant and th
2 CONC e historical verity of the Bible is confirmed. 
