2 CONT 18th Dynasty
2 CONT
2 CONT Wadjmose was a prince during the time of the 18th Dynasty. He was the son of King Tuthmosis I (1504-1492 B.C.) and Queen 'Ahmose. He died when he was young or was set aside for Tuthmosis II, but either way, never became king. He w
2 CONC as, however, a brother to Hatshepsut.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source:
