1 NOTE OR "PIMAI""PEMOU""PAMAI"; GREAT CHIEF OF MA; PRINCE OF SAIS; PER-'O 773-767 BC
1 NOTE DSI :  Son of Sheshonq III and Tentamenopet, brother of Bakennefi, the prince and regent of Athribis and Heliopolis. A few relics are preserved only in the Delta. Group statue from Sais presents him in times before he came to the 
2 CONC rule and names him  Governor of Libyans  -  Meshwesh . It is possible that he was buried in tomb II in royal necropolis at Tanis.
