2 CONC nt Egypt, Thames & Hudson (2004), p.157 ^ Arielle Kozloff & Betsy Bryan, "Royal and Divine Statuary," Egypt’s Dazzling Sun: Amenhotep III and his World, (Cleveland, 1992), p.425, fig.XIV.1 ^ Dodson, JEA 76, p.87 ^ Dodson & Hilton,
