2 CONT It is rather controversial, and very unproven, to use any of them as the link between the 18th and the 19th dynasties of pharaos. 
2 CONT
2 CONT There are various pedigrees that make the link, like http://fabpedigree.com/s049/f387476.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Atenmert is assumed to be = Neferneferuaten or Meritaten
2 CONT
2 CONT but Sitre is also confused with a later Sitre there.
2 CONT
2 CONT And there doesn't seem to be any traditional sources that say anything like that.
