1 OCCU founded 25th Dynasty, Founder of the 25th dynasty of Egypt who ruled Egypt from 747 BC to c. 722 BC.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piye
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Piye was the son of Kashta and Pebatjma. He is known to have had three or four wives. Abar was the mother of his successor Taharqa. Further wives are Tabiry, Peksater and probably Khensa.
2 CONT
2 CONT Piye was the father of King Taharqa and the God's Wife of Amun Shepenwepet II. A daughter named Qalhata would later marry King Shabaka, she was the mother of king Tanutamun and probably of King Shabataka as well.
2 CONT
2 CONT Three of his daughters - Tabekenamun, Naparaye and Takahatenamun - married their brother Taharqa. Another daughter, Arty, married king Shabataka.
2 CONT
2 CONT Piye had two further sons named Har and Khaliut.
