1 NOTE PER-'O OF EGYPT 610-595 BC; DEFEATED JOSIAJ, KING OF JUDAH, AT MEGIDDO
2 CONT (MENTIONED IN KINGS 23:29-30); BATTLE OF CARCHEMISH 605 BC; DEFEATED
2 CONT NEBUCHADREZZAR 601 BC ON EGYPTIAN BORDER; BEGAN CONSTRUCTION OF RED SEA CANAL;
2 CONT HIS FLEET SUCCESSFULLY CIRCUMNAVIGATED AFRICA AFTER 3 YEAR VOYAGE
