2 CONC Dynasty of Egypt who reigned for 8 years (672–664 BCE) according to Manetho's Epitome. Egypt was reunified by his son Psamtik I. his daughter     https://www.geni.com/people/Scota-Queen-of-the-Gadelians-fictitious/6000000000077265
