1 NOTE OR "PSAMMETICHUS""PSAMMETICHOS""PSAMATIK"; PER-'O 664-610 BC; VASSAL OF
2 CONT ASSYRIA; EXPELLED THE ASSYRIANS, REUNITED THE COUNTRY, AND ESTABLISHED THE
2 CONT CAPITOL AT SAIS; POSSIBLY MARRIED TO NA.NEFER.HERES (OR MEH.TENU.SEKHT),
2 CONT DAUGHTER OF HARSIESE, GREAT SEER OF HELIOPOLIS, OR TO SHEPENAPT
