1 CONT ^  Tyldeseley pp. 189-193 and Wells pp 194-195, see sources below. 
1 CONT ^  Tyldeseley pp. 137-144, see sources below 
1 CONT ^  The Unfinished Obelisk by Peter Tyson March 16, 1999 NOVA online adventure 
1 CONT ^  The Queens of Egypt Part One, by Sameh Arab 
1 CONT ^  Tyldeseley pp. 210, see sources below 
1 CONT ^  Tyldeseley pp. 213-214, see sources below 
1 CONT ^  Wells pp. 253-261, see sources below 
1 CONT ^  Redford, p. 87. 
1 CONT ^  Seawright see sources below 
1 CONT [edit]
