1 CONC
1 CONT The Egyptian, motion picture (1954, directed by Michael Curtiz, Twentieth Century-Fox Film Corporation), based on the novel by Mika Waltari. 
1 CONT Gwendolyn MacEwen: historical novel King of Egypt, King of Dreams (1971, ISBN 1894663608) 
1 CONT Agatha Christie: play, Akhnaton: A Play in Three Acts (Dodd, Mead [New York], 1973, ISBN 0396068227; Collins [London], 1973, ISBN 0002110385) 
1 CONT Philip Glass: opera, Akhnaten: An Opera in Three Acts (1983; CBS Records, 1987) 
1 CONT Naguib Mahfouz, novel, Akhenaten: Dweller in Truth (1985) 
